"""Paradigms for the verbs Taṣrīf al-ʿIzzī brings to the lexicon, through the project's sarf generator.
usage: python3 tools/authoring/izzi/sarf_izzi.py tools/authoring/izzi/morph_extra.json   (run from arabic-app)

The matn cites most of these verbs as MODELS of a bāb or of a class of weak verb, so each paradigm is the table the
matn itself recites or points to («وَقِسْ عَلَى هٰذَا»). The rarer bābs (اِفْعَوْعَلَ، اِفْعَنْلَلَ، اِفْعَنْلَى، اِفْعَوَّلَ،
اِفْعَالَّ، اِفْعَلَلَّ) are built with explicit stems; nothing here is guessed from a neighbouring bāb."""
